 Returns `204 No Content` on success.
 
+## Board publication
+
+`public_url` is `null` until an account admin publishes the board. Publishing does not change who can access the member-only board or edit its cards.
+
+### `POST /:account_slug/boards/:board_id/publication`
+
+Publishes the board and returns `200 OK` with the board JSON, including its secret `public_url`. Only account admins with access to the board can publish it. Publishing an already published board keeps the same link.
+
+Anyone with the link can view these read-only HTML pages without signing in:
+
+- `/:account_slug/public/boards/:key` — the board
+- `/:account_slug/public/boards/:key/columns/:id` — a column on the board
+- `/:account_slug/public/boards/:key/cards/:number` — a published card on the board (never a draft)
+
+### `DELETE /:account_slug/boards/:board_id/publication`
+
+Unpublishes the board and returns `204 No Content`. Only account admins with access to the board can unpublish it. Existing public links to the board, its columns, and its cards stop working. Publishing again generates a new link.
+
 ## Board Accesses
 
 Board accesses let you see who has access to a board and their involvement level (watching or access only). Any board member can view this information.
